### Performance Tuning

**Optimize Span Export Configuration**:
```csharp
builder.Services.AddOpenTelemetry()
    .WithTracing(tracing => tracing
        .AddOtlpExporter(options =>
        {
            options.Endpoint = new Uri("http://jaeger-collector:4317");
            options.Protocol = OtlpExportProtocol.Grpc;

            // Batch configuration
            options.BatchExportProcessorOptions = new BatchExportProcessorOptions<Activity>
            {
                MaxQueueSize = 2048,              // Max spans buffered
                ScheduledDelayMillis = 5000,       // Export every 5 seconds
                ExporterTimeoutMillis = 30000,     // 30 second timeout
                MaxExportBatchSize = 512,          // Max 512 spans per batch
            };
        })
    );
```

**Monitor Tracing Overhead**:
```csharp
// Add metrics to track tracing performance
builder.Services.AddOpenTelemetry()
    .WithMetrics(metrics => metrics
        .AddMeter("OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AspNetCore")
        .AddPrometheusExporter()
    );

// Metrics exposed:
// - otel_span_processor_queue_size: Spans waiting export
// - otel_span_processor_dropped_spans: Spans dropped due to queue full
// - otel_exporter_sent_spans: Successfully exported spans
// - otel_exporter_failed_spans: Export failures
```
